{
  "id": 409151833,
  "iid": 21001,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "bthci_cmd: Display vendor command in packet details",
  "description": "Vendor command parameters are not visible in packet details view which makes HCI traffic debugging difficult when using `tshark -V`:\n\n```\nBluetooth HCI Command - Vendor Command 0xfc80\n    Command Opcode: Unknown (0xfc80)\n        1111 11.. .... .... = Opcode Group Field: Vendor-Specific Commands (0x3f)\n        .... ..00 1000 0000 = Opcode Command Field: 0x080\n    Parameter Total Length: 2\n    Parameter\n```\n\nAfter changes in this merge request:\n```\nBluetooth HCI Command - Vendor Command 0xfc80\n    Command Opcode: Unknown (0xfc80)\n        1111 11.. .... .... = Opcode Group Field: Vendor-Specific Commands (0x3f)\n        .... ..00 1000 0000 = Opcode Command Field: 0x080\n    Parameter Total Length: 2\n    Parameter: 0100\n```",
  "state": "merged",
