        {
          "id": 2708711525,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It looks like it makes sense to display parameter even if vendor dissector is found. See attached screenshot:\n![Screenshot_from_2025-08-26_09-07-41](/uploads/832a4eac9ab9024b74e7a694bbd0527e/Screenshot_from_2025-08-26_09-07-41.png)\n\nHowever, I've added a check not to display the parameter if the `param_length == 0`, because it causes the field to display `<MISSING>`.",
