        {
          "id": 2709515327,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I'm not sure I see why it makes sense to display the parameter bytes if it's being dissected by a vendor dissector.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
