        {
          "id": 2709568644,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "IMHO, the best way would be to keep only Broadcom (vendor) dissector, unify keys and somehow allow to filter vendor commands by vendor name (or maybe it will be possible without any more change?) However, this will break vendor filters like `bthci_vendor.broadcom.parameter_length` if someone is using it.",
